+/*
+ * Fit R/G, B/G ratios to the locus: the colour temperature of the nearest
+ * point on it, interpolated in mired (reciprocal colour temperature, in
+ * which white points are close to evenly spaced) along the nearest
+ * segment, and the ratios moved to within the transverse band around that
+ * point.
